    "updated_at": "2025-03-28T05:56:03Z",
    "body": "> WebKit (already implemented)\r\n\r\nThis is not what WebKit implements. WebKit follows the \"broken\" spec since https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/6e3d19b20a3743ff9679d3362dd577ce21838f4f . \r\n\r\nIn principle, changing it to follow this PR shouldn't be hard and without behavior changes but it's an unnecessary effort that can cause regressions though.",
